# S1 (mer3ly site canvas plan, Rulings 124, 128 and 129): the practice proof
# on the shared host dataset input, with one relationship its source
# discloses between the two subjects. Run as
# practice.html?dataset=fixtures/woodshed-comparison-relations.host-dataset.json
# The same comparison, cards and slots as the served practice dataset; the
# relationship is routed onto the recipe's arrangement, drawn between its
# two cards, and named to a reader beside the board.
assert snap practice-view == relations
assert snap practice-relations == 1
assert attr [data-practice-id="relations-list"] aria-label Relations Shares C and E: C Major to A Minor
settle 2
capture practice_relations_grid
wait
dom click [data-practice-command="scatter"]
settle 2
assert snap practice-layout == scatter.default
assert snap practice-relations == 1
capture practice_relations_scatter
wait
log practice relations receipt complete
